      "The buyer receives the full structured procurement package: executive recommendation, comparison matrix, risk assessment, evidence and decision rationale.": "买方收到完整的结构化采购包：高管推荐、比对矩阵、风险评估、证据与决策依据。",
      "The first four modules produce evidence. The fifth module produces the decision — opportunity, risk, and a single recommendation that the buyer can act on.": "前四个模块产出证据。第五个模块产出决策——机会、风险，以及买方可以据此行动的一项推荐。",
