      "The full structured procurement package: executive recommendation, comparison matrix, risk assessment, evidence package, decision rationale and management-ready report.": "完整的结构化采购包：高管推荐、比对矩阵、风险评估、证据包、决策依据与管理层就绪报告。",
      "The industries we focus on share one trait: the cost of a bad supplier decision is high — measured in delays, quality failures, or production downtime. HEXU's value sits exactly there: in the part of the process where evidence and judgment matter most.": "我们聚焦的行业有一个共同点：糟糕供应商决策的成本很高——体现在延误、质量失败或停产。HEXU 的价值正在于此：在流程中最依赖证据与判断的环节。",
      "The more detail you can share, the more precisely HEXU can scope the engagement. All fields are reviewed directly by the HEXU team.": "您分享的细节越多，HEXU 越能精确界定合作范围。所有字段都由 HEXU 团队直接审阅。",
