      "The remaining candidate demonstrates documented legitimacy, consistent quality systems and manageable risk — supporting a clear, evidence-based recommendation to the buyer.": "剩余候选者展现出有据可查的合法性、稳定的质量体系与可控风险——支撑一份对买方清晰、基于证据的推荐。",
      "These terms apply when you use the HEXU website and submit a project enquiry. By using the site, you agree to them.": "当您使用 HEXU 网站并提交项目问询时，本条款适用。使用本网站即表示您同意这些条款。",
      "This is an open suggestion box. Whether it is a feature idea, a correction, a request for a topic, or a critique — every message is read by the HEXU team. You do not need to be a client to share one.": "这是一个开放的建言箱。无论是功能想法、纠正、主题请求还是批评——每一条信息都由 HEXU 团队阅读。您无需是客户就能分享。",
